Path expression evaluator:
- `ast.Constant` str → literal
- `ast.Name` in env → env value
- `ast.Attribute` `.parent` → dirname
- `ast.Subscript` `.parents[N]` → ancestor
- `ast.Call`:
  - `Path(...)` → eval arg
  - `Path(__file__)` → the file
  - `.resolve()` → same
  - `.parent` is Attribute...
- `ast.BinOp` Div → join
- `ast.Call` `.glob(...)`: treat as dir (we expand anyway)
- `ast.JoinedStr` f-strings: attempt only if all parts literal (skip otherwise)

